        "description": "IAM role has inline policies. Permissions are embedded in the role and invisible to managed-policy enumeration.",
        "action": "Convert inline policies to managed policies. Use aws iam list-role-policies to enumerate inline policies, then aws iam create-policy to create equivalent managed policies, attach them, and delete the inline policies.",
        "example": "{\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"kind\": \"role\",\n    \"policies\": {\n      \"has_inline_policies\": false\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
      },
